	<div class="row nest first wide">
	
	<div class="inner col col8 first last id1356db75-886e-408a-bca9-717fba8a392e" style="" data-widgetcontainerid="1356db75-886e-408a-bca9-717fba8a392e">	
<div class="widget editor pageStyles narrow" id="divEditor81c6c6f1-707b-4ebb-879e-e9647a4f1cb4" data-elementqueryclasses='{"wide-narrow":"min-width:25em"}'>
	    <div class="fr-view">


        <table class="telerik-reTable-2" style="width: 100%; text-align: center;"><thead><tr class="telerik-reTableHeaderRow-2" width="30%"><th class="subhead2" color="white" style="text-align: center;"><strong><span style="color: rgb(255, 255, 255);">Ballot Information</span></strong></th></tr></thead><tbody><tr class="telerik-reTableOddRow-2" width="30%"><td class="telerik-reTableEvenCol-2" style="background-color: rgb(245, 245, 245);"><ul><li><a class="Hyperlink docaccess-activated" href="/DocumentCenter/View/13059/Candidate-List" target="_self" data-docaccess-source-url="https://www.lakecountyil.gov/DocumentCenter/View/13059/Candidate-List" data-url-hash="archived" data-url-status="archived">Candidate List</a></li><li><a class="Hyperlink docaccess-activated" href="/DocumentCenter/View/21161/Referenda" target="_self" data-docaccess-source-url="https://www.lakecountyil.gov/DocumentCenter/View/21161/Referenda" data-url-hash="20cf27a6550d4f640ac467f5547622a24404427307d70111487c987d93fcf078" data-url-status="disabled">Referenda</a></li><li><a class="Hyperlink" href="/351/Voter-Power" target="_self">Track Lake County Clerk&apos;s receipt of your application and voted ballot by mail</a></li><li><a class="Hyperlink docaccess-activated" href="/DocumentCenter/View/27096/" target="_blank" rel="noopener" data-docaccess-source-url="https://www.lakecountyil.gov/DocumentCenter/View/27096/" data-url-hash="a744642da3ce245e56b4762bc13a2fda84d6d267ca8285774a4929e08b34bcf3" data-url-status="disabled">Voter Information Guide</a></li><li style="display:none;"><a href="/DocumentCenter/View/88773/Electing-Democratic-State-Central-Committeepersons">Electing Democratic State Central Committeepersons</a></li></ul></td></tr></tbody></table><p style="display: block;"><span class="subhead2" style="text-align: center; color: #00568c;"><strong>What is On My Ballot</strong>
<br>
</span>To see a sample ballot for your Lake County address, please enter house number, street name and zip code. Please call 847-377-Vote (8683) if address is not found.</p>
    </div>

