			</div><!-- outer column --><!----><div class="outer col col8" style="" data-widgetcontainerid="7b787f17-7721-4ab0-96bc-c59739124ec0">				
	<div class="row nest first last wide">
	
	<div class="inner col col8 first last id7cdecff5-bdff-4807-b53d-749491162f9d" style="" data-widgetcontainerid="7cdecff5-bdff-4807-b53d-749491162f9d">	
<div class="widget editor pageStyles narrow" id="divEditore8eca909-3ca5-4f4a-a75e-e119eb105704" data-elementqueryclasses='{"wide-narrow":"min-width:25em"}'>
	    <div class="fr-view">


        <table class="telerik-reTable-2" style="width: 100%; text-align: center;"><thead><tr class="telerik-reTableHeaderRow-2" width="30%"><th class="subhead2" style="text-align: center;"><strong><span style="color: rgb(255, 255, 255);">Voter Registration</span></strong></th></tr></thead><tbody><tr class="telerik-reTableOddRow-2" width="30%"><td class="telerik-reTableOddCol-2" style="background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);"><h3 class="subhead2">Register online</h3><ul><li>Available until Oct 18, 2026</li><li><a aria-label="State Board of Elections' Illinois Online Voter Registration Application Website Opens in new window" class="Hyperlink" href="https://ova.elections.il.gov/" rel="noopener" target="_blank">State Board of Elections&apos; Illinois Online Voter Registration Application Website</a></li><li>Valid Illinois Driver&apos;s License or State Identification Card is required</li></ul><h3 class="subhead2">Register in person</h3><ul><li>With a <a class="Hyperlink" href="/DocumentCenter/View/1040" target="_self">deputy registrar</a> until Oct 6, 2026</li><li>At any Illinois Secretary of State <a aria-label="Driver's Service Facility Opens in new window" class="Hyperlink" href="https://www.ilsos.gov/facilityfinder/facility" rel="noopener" target="_blank">Driver&apos;s Service Facility</a> when there for other services until Oct 18, 2026</li></ul><h3 class="subhead2">Grace Period Registration</h3><ul><li>Sept 24 to Oct 16, 2026 at Lake County Clerk&apos;s office only</li><li>Available at any early voting site when open Oct 19 to Nov 2</li><li>On Election Day, you can register at any voting site or the Lake County Main Courthouse Lobby</li><li>You must vote at the time of registration</li></ul><h3 class="subhead2">Registration requirements</h3>You must:<ul><li>be a U.S. citizen,</li><li>be a resident of your precinct for 30 days before Election Day,</li><li>be 18 years old on or before Nov 3, 2026,<br>AND</li><li>provide two <a class="Hyperlink" href="/4113/Identification-for-Registration-and-Voti" target="_self">forms of valid identification</a>. <em>Both pieces of identification must show your current name, and one must show your current Lake County physical street address.</em></li></ul><a class="Hyperlink" href="/351/Voter-Power" target="_self"><h3 class="subhead2">Check your registration status</h3></a><br><a class="Hyperlink" href="/351/Voter-Power" target="_self"><h3 class="subhead2">Print your personalized <em>Certificate of Registration</em> card</h3></a></td></tr></tbody></table>
    </div>

<script type="text/javascript">
